      "text": [
        " إِنَّ مِنْ حَقِّ الْمُسْلِمِ عَلَى الْمُسْلِمِ أَنْ يُجِيبَهُ إِذَا دَعَاهُ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ali Bin Al Hakam, from Musny Al hannat, from Is’haq Bin Yazeed, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘It is from a right of the Muslim upon the Muslim that he answers when he is invited (for a meal)’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. Ahmad ibn Muhammad has narrated from Ali ibn al-Hakam from Muthanna’ al-Hannat from Ishaq ibn Yazid who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘It is of the rights of a Muslim on a Muslim to accept his invitation.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
